<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on EMS-Chemie.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on EMS-Chemie.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 3.5 million American-style bull-spread call warrants on bearer shares of EMS-Chemie Holding AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> UPPER STRIKE    5,000 CHF		 PREMIUM	7.2 PCT</p>
<p> LOWER STRIKE    6,000 CHF		 REALLOWANCE  0.10 CHF</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.70 CHF		  GEARING	13.5 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.JAN.97-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	20.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  5010 CHF</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
